@HtmlToPdfApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5072

### Ticket termico 80mm (alto automatico)
POST {{HtmlToPdfApi_HostAddress}}/api/pdf
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "html": "<h3 style='text-align:center'>TICKET #1</h3><p>Item A ..... $10.00</p><hr/><b>Total $15.00</b>",
  "paperSize": "Thermal80",
  "styleSheetUrls": ["https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/normalize.css@8.0.1/normalize.css"]
}

### Hoja A4
POST {{HtmlToPdfApi_HostAddress}}/api/pdf
Content-Type: application/json

{ "html": "<h1>Hola</h1>", "paperSize": "A4" }
